---
source: tests/lexer_corpus.rs
expression: formatted
input_file: examples/01-hello.i
---
KwModule               @ 0..6
UpperIdent "Main"      @ 7..11
Newline                @ 11..12
Indent                 @ 16..16
KwExpose               @ 16..22
LowerIdent "main"      @ 23..27
Newline                @ 27..28
Dedent                 @ 29..29
LowerIdent "main"      @ 29..33
Equals                 @ 34..35
Newline                @ 35..36
Indent                 @ 40..40
LowerIdent "print"     @ 40..45
Bang                   @ 45..46
StringLit "hello, world" @ 47..61
Newline                @ 61..62
Dedent                 @ 62..62
Eof                    @ 62..62
